        "internalPageId": null,
        "title": "To Consider 1. The other adverbial clauses are considered such since they can move within the sentences without affecting the meaning. 2. There are also adverbial clauses of time, contrast, comparison: Time: Whenever you do that, I hate it! Contrast: Different from all we have seen, I still have one argument. Comparison: I am ok with all that as long as we all are safe.",
