        "title": "There are some functions that we can cover when using the grammar learned in this unit.",
        "visibleTexts": [
          "There are some functions that we can cover when using the grammar learned in this unit.",
          "Functions Examples 1 Express disagreement towards certain actions I hate it when someone yells in public. It upsets my mum when we do not clean our room. 2 State enjoyment in regards certain actions It brightens my days when someone thinks on me and texts me. I love it when my kids help me with the housework. 3 Show you are ok with people’s doings John did not bring white cardboard but yellow. I don’t mind the color as long as he brought one."
        ],
