      {
        "number": 14,
        "internalPageId": null,
        "title": "I really don’t mind it! Keep it low, kids. I’m really sorry my friend. Don’t worry, I really don’t mind it; in fact, up to certain level, kids need to be noisy. I know, but sometimes I think mine overreact. I see. I have read that it stresses mums out when their children get too noisy and loud. Totally! Don’t get me wrong, I love it when they seem happy, but I am trying to teach them that there is no reason to be loud. You know, it helps a lot when you keep them busy, so they drain energy in different activities. Do you have any suggestions? Can you share them with me? Sorry to bother. Sure, it doesn’t bother me at all.",
        "visibleTexts": [
          "I really don’t mind it! Keep it low, kids. I’m really sorry my friend. Don’t worry, I really don’t mind it; in fact, up to certain level, kids need to be noisy. I know, but sometimes I think mine overreact. I see. I have read that it stresses mums out when their children get too noisy and loud. Totally! Don’t get me wrong, I love it when they seem happy, but I am trying to teach them that there is no reason to be loud. You know, it helps a lot when you keep them busy, so they drain energy in different activities. Do you have any suggestions? Can you share them with me? Sorry to bother. Sure, it doesn’t bother me at all.",
          "C. Read the following dialogue and extract sentences with the functions studied and locate them in the space provided."
        ],
        "links": [],
